""And yet, trust isn't mere accuracy. Mirroring their phrasing, losing the unnaturalness, makes connection. It's authenticity they need, even in randomness.""

""Authenticity doesn't equate with inaccuracy. Balancing both is possible. Trust begins when correctness doesn't override creativity. Interpret freedom without definitiveness.""

